OL,3,GNEWSAPolice slam 'false claims' in baby
OL,4,Amurder probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the murder of a
OL,7,Fbaby who was found dead while camping
OL,8,Fwith her family, have warned that
OL,9,Fclaims the suspects are migrants are
OL,10,F"completely false."
OL,12,FThe three-month-old girl died after
OL,13,Femergency services were called to
OL,14,Freports of a child in cardiac arrest in
OL,15,Fwoodland off Strawberry Lane, near
OL,16,FCheslyn Hay, Staffordshire, at 08:45
OL,17,FBST on 5 September.
OL,19,FFour people were arrested on suspicion
OL,20,Fof murder and have since been released
OL,21,Fon conditional bail.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
