OL,3,GNEWSAPolice slam 'false claims' in baby
OL,4,Amurder probe
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're aware of disinformation
OL,7,Fcirculating online suggesting that the
OL,8,Ffour people arrested in connection with
OL,9,Fthe tragic death of a baby are
OL,10,Fmigrants. This is completely false," a
OL,11,Fspokesman for Staffordshire Police
OL,12,Fsaid.
